> Improving Your Hit Points

> Each nurse is good for about 10-15 hit points

It depends.  One out of seven hits have a chance of incrementing max HP; 
the rest merely provide healing.  After each "good" hit, there is a 1/13 
chance the nurse will vanish.  You might expect 13 HP/nurse, but not 
every "good" hit increases HP:

If you have less than 7 HP/XL, it will always increase max HP.
If you have 25 HP/XL or more, it will never increase max HP.
If you have exactly 16 HP/XL, there is a 50% chance of an increase.

The chance of an increase is not linear, so when significantly above the 
16 HP/XL midpoint the chance is nearly 0%, and when significantly below 
nearly 100%.

The moral is that a normal character can expect 12HP/nurse at first, but 
one who has been using HP gain methods like alchemy, prayer, or other 
nurses will get less, or almost nothing.

